Prompt Engineering Workflow Pack for German-speaking Marketing Agencies

This workflow pack contains the following:
- Step-by-step guide for creating effective prompts
- Checklist for prompt engineering best practices
- SOP pack for prompt engineering processes
- Template for tracking prompt performance metrics

Target Customer: DE/EU small business

QA Checklist:
- [ ] All steps are clear and easy to follow
- [ ] Checklist covers all prompt engineering best practices
- [ ] SOP pack is comprehensive and covers all necessary processes
- [ ] Template is easy to use and tracks all necessary metrics